This patch is not standalone: its tests call `raster_fb`, and
`0007-debug-hide-node.patch` is what defines that helper in
`engine/core/src/tests.rs`. Sorted order lands 0007 first, so the dependency is
satisfied today. If 0007 is ever dropped, `engine/core` stops compiling in its
test profile and the error names `raster_fb` in this patch's tests rather than
the patch that went away.

The upstream copy carries its own six-line `raster_fb` and is otherwise
identical: pocket-stack/pocketjs#301.

`git apply` skips everything above the first `diff --git`, which was checked
against a tree freshly cloned at the pin rather than assumed.

